#: display.php:295 display.php:297
msgid "Refresh by Poller"
msgstr "Uppdatering via insamlingsprocessen"

#: include/functions.php:491
msgid "Dashboard has been added, please wait few poller cycle for data"
msgstr ""
"Instrumentpanelen har lagts till. Vänta några insamlingscykler på data"

#: include/functions.php:883
msgid ""
"No Data Present.  Either Force Update, or wait for next Cacti Polling cycle."
msgstr ""
"Inga data finns. Tvinga fram en uppdatering eller vänta på nästa "
"insamlingscykel i Cacti."

#: include/functions.php:885
msgid ""
"No Data Present.  This Panel does not allow for Forced Updates.  You will "
"have to wait until the Cacti's Poller to perform the check."
msgstr ""
"Inga data finns. Den här panelen tillåter inte framtvingade uppdateringar. "
"Vänta tills Cactis insamlingsprocess utför kontrollen."

#: include/variables.php:61
msgid "Automatically by poller"
msgstr "Automatiskt via insamlingsprocessen"

#: include/variables.php:101
msgid "Poller Timeout"
msgstr "Tidsgräns för insamlingsprocessen"

#: include/variables.php:102
msgid ""
"The amount of time, in minutes, that the Intropage background poller can run"
" before being interrupted and killed by Cacti."
msgstr ""
"Den tid i minuter som Intropages insamlingsprocess får köras i bakgrunden "
"innan Cacti avbryter den."

#: include/variables.php:125 include/variables.php:158
#: include/variables.php:176
msgid "Poller runs this task. It could cause long poller run."
msgstr ""
"Insamlingsprocessen kör den här uppgiften. Det kan leda till en lång "
"insamlingskörning."

#: include/variables.php:313
msgid "Alarm Red/Yellow Polling Time"
msgstr "Rött eller gult larm för insamlingstid"

#: include/variables.php:314
msgid ""
"Polling times above these thresholds will trigger a Warning or Alert status "
"color."
msgstr ""
"Insamlingstider över dessa tröskelvärden ger statusfärgen för varning eller "
"larm."

#: panellib/analyze.php:614 panellib/analyze.php:1431
msgid ""
"Please have a look to device parameter \"Bulk Walk Maximum Repetitions\". "
"You can improve your poller performance"
msgstr ""
"Kontrollera enhetsparametern ”Bulk Walk Maximum Repetitions”. Du kan "
"förbättra insamlingens prestanda"

